IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPECINFER-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DRAFT-LEN           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACCEPTANCE-PCT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BARRIER-LATENCY-US  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100  PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPECINFER-V2.
    IF DRAFT-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 89 TO ACCEPTANCE-PCT.
    MOVE 52 TO BARRIER-LATENCY-US.
    MOVE 315 TO SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 DRAFT-LEN.
    WEIGHT 30 ACCEPTANCE-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
